text = "LEVEL EDITOR

Keyboard Tools:
1 - Wall (Gray)
2 - Coin (Yellow) 
3 - Spike (Red)
4 - Player Spawn (Green)
5 - Erase

Mouse Controls:
- Left Click: Place current tile
- Right Click: Erase any tile

Commands:
- S: Save level to file
- L: Test in main game
- C: Clear all (add borders)

Tips:
- Level auto-saves as template
- Grid shows 64x64 tiles
- Each level needs 1 player spawn"
